(7598726, 1227257, 21084, '<td valign="top">Love your title,<br/>Great photo<br/>Thanks for sharing</td>', 'Love your title,Great photoThanks for sharing', '2018-10-14 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598727, 1227243, 87808, '<td valign="top">I got really excited when I saw the title of this photo. I wish the clutter behind her was not visible, or at least cropped to her ears, so not showing the modern door frame or couch. <br/>Some people are going to be like, ''oh a blurry cat, whohooo ''not'''' ''or it is just for a PS award cus it is blurry and black and white, or they just shoved something into this challenge''.But it is obvious you thought about this beforehand.  But with that title you took it to another level, and I think you should have done more to live up to that title. <br/>And now I sound all bitchy and whiny, but I absolutely am infatuated with the Egyptian times. So sorry, but not really. Sorry again for that.<br/> <br/>Sorry coming back to comment a bit more.  If you had cropped it by the ears, it would have looked like plinths, that makes sense, it would have totally been a fabulous shot.  But I bet people wouldn''t have got it.<br/>I am going to stop rambling now.</td>', 'I got really excited when I saw the title of this photo. I wish the clutter behind her was not visible, or at least cropped to her ears, so not showing the modern door frame or couch. Some people are going to be like, ''oh a blurry cat, whohooo ''not'''' ''or it is just for a PS award cus it is blurry and black and white, or they just shoved something into this challenge''.But it is obvious you thought about this beforehand.  But with that title you took it to another level, and I think you should have done more to live up to that title. And now I sound all bitchy and whiny, but I absolutely am infatuated with the Egyptian times. So sorry, but not really. Sorry again for that. Sorry coming back to comment a bit more.  If you had cropped it by the ears, it would have looked like plinths, that makes sense, it would have totally been a fabulous shot.  But I bet people wouldn''t have got it.I am going to stop rambling now.', '2018-10-14 15:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7598728, 1227136, 87808, '<td valign="top">I do not get it, unless you love the sweet potato''s religiosity. But you do have a set of glowing eyeballs and face  in that bush that look like a Demon.</td>', 'I do not get it, unless you love the sweet potato''s religiosity. But you do have a set of glowing eyeballs and face  in that bush that look like a Demon.', '2018-10-14 15:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
