(7598869, 1227222, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo, Juliet.  Congratulations on receiving a well-deserved blue ribbon.  I''m glad you were able to feature this mysterious church, which you''ve previously talked about as well as giving us some of its fabled background.  You''re a fine chronicler of the southwest.  Your recent entry in Pathways II, "Path of Rosa", is also superb and was, by the way, my favorite entry in that challenge.  The well-known magazine Arizona Highways features a "Photo of the Day", and these images would look great in the company of the other beautiful shots they publish.</td>', 'Terrific photo, Juliet.  Congratulations on receiving a well-deserved blue ribbon.  I''m glad you were able to feature this mysterious church, which you''ve previously talked about as well as giving us some of its fabled background.  You''re a fine chronicler of the southwest.  Your recent entry in Pathways II, "Path of Rosa", is also superb and was, by the way, my favorite entry in that challenge.  The well-known magazine Arizona Highways features a "Photo of the Day", and these images would look great in the company of the other beautiful shots they publish.', '2018-10-17 09:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
